{"version":1,"content":"<p>金曲歌后蔡琴上月無預警宣布將於2027年12月31日完成最後一場演出後正式封咪，意味着她長達數十年的輝煌歌唱生涯即將進入倒數階段。</p><p>臨別秋波，蔡琴近日罕有登上內地節目，更首度破天荒澄清纏擾她近29年的「柏拉圖式無性婚姻」傳聞。</p><p>蔡琴情緒激動地直</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T07:23:56.437628+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T07:01:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T07:17:16.223455+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T07:17:16.223455+00:00","content_hash":"83000507dcf1662538b9200cf2fa295fa337fc4015aed521acea9721fbffc7eb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}